{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "84cf2f36-b8f5-4f65-bb82-1dd4fb6b0eef",
    "name": "Clinic Appointment System API",
    "description": "Postman Collection covering all public API endpoints for Auth, Patients, Doctors, and Manager, including successful workflows, input validation failures, authorization failures, missing resources, and business-rule conflicts.\n\nQuick start:\n1. Start MongoDB and the backend (default http://localhost:5000).\n2. Run the health check.\n3. Register a patient or log in with seeded/demo accounts. The login requests save tokens into collection variables automatically.\n4. Set doctorId, slotId, appointmentId, userId, and managerDoctorId from responses before running dependent requests. doctorId is the Doctor profile _id (not the doctor's User id).\n5. Slot creation requests generate future ISO timestamps automatically. Run as a doctor, then use the returned slot id in patient booking requests.\n\nCollection variables: baseUrl, patientToken, doctorToken, managerToken, doctorId, managerDoctorId, slotId, appointmentId, userId. Use separate collection copies/environments for different databases. Error-request descriptions specify the necessary setup and expected status.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const start = new Date(Date.now() + 2 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);",
          "start.setSeconds(0, 0);",
          "const end = new Date(start.getTime() + 30 * 60 * 1000);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('slotStart', start.toISOString());",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('slotEnd', end.toISOString());",
          "const overlapStart = new Date(start.getTime() + 5 * 60 * 1000);",
          "const overlapEnd = new Date(end.getTime() + 25 * 60 * 1000);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('overlapStart', overlapStart.toISOString());",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('overlapEnd', overlapEnd.toISOString());",
          "const localDate = [start.getFullYear(), String(start.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0'), String(start.getDate()).padStart(2, '0')].join('-');",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('slotDate', localDate);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
